`face_attached_depth` is written to `runs/Absolute_2026-09-28_02/decisions/cycle-004/proposal-1.json`.

For each successful stage-2 estimate, the pose result gains the pallet width, height, and depth. Width and height are the factory face that match already uses. Depth is the far side of the returns that fall inside that face and stay within one face-height step of the face plane, so a load, the floor, and a later surface are not that length. The pose, the yaw, and the admitted and deferred detection indices stay as they are.
